{"articleNo":"514590","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=514590&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 「2025 동북아시아 교류의 날개 in 시마네」 사업 참가자 모집(수정)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2025.05.22","hit":"3443","attachments":[{"name":"3. 참가개요(한국어).docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=514590&attachNo=143684"},{"name":"5. 교통안내.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=514590&attachNo=143685"},{"name":"7.참가자신청서(한국어).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=514590&attachNo=143686"},{"name":"6. 참가신청서(일본어양식).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=514590&attachNo=144000"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t경상북도에서는&nbsp;오는&nbsp;8.22(금)&nbsp;~&nbsp;8.27(수)&nbsp;일정으로<br>\n일본&nbsp;시마네현에서&nbsp;개최되는&nbsp;「2024&nbsp;동북아시아&nbsp;교류의&nbsp;날개&nbsp;in&nbsp;시마네」에&nbsp;참가할&nbsp;도내&nbsp;대학(원)생&nbsp;3명을&nbsp;모집합니다.<br>\n관심&nbsp;있는&nbsp;학생께서는&nbsp;붙임&nbsp;문서(한국어,일본어양식)을&nbsp;작성하여&nbsp;6월&nbsp;3일(화)까지&nbsp;아래&nbsp;메일로&nbsp;보내주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.<br>\n<br>\n*붙임문서(한국어,일본어양식)에&nbsp;포함된&nbsp;일정표에&nbsp;출국,귀국&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;작성해주시길&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;<br>\n(1)&nbsp;한국&nbsp;→&nbsp;마쓰에시&nbsp;이동&nbsp;방법<br>\n(2)&nbsp;이즈모&nbsp;공항&nbsp;또는&nbsp;마쓰에역에서&nbsp;배웅&nbsp;후&nbsp;→&nbsp;한국&nbsp;귀국&nbsp;일정&nbsp;및&nbsp;이동&nbsp;방법<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;※&nbsp;국제교류교육원&nbsp;서혜준&nbsp;(hyejun@kumoh.ac.kr&nbsp;/&nbsp;054-478-7215)<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n이&nbsp;모집은&nbsp;대학교에서&nbsp;경상북도로&nbsp;참가자&nbsp;소개표&nbsp;및&nbsp;명단을&nbsp;6월&nbsp;6일(금)까지&nbsp;제출해야&nbsp;하는&nbsp;것이므로,&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n전달&nbsp;기간을&nbsp;감안하여&nbsp;6월&nbsp;3일(화)까지&nbsp;모집을&nbsp;받을&nbsp;예정이오니&nbsp;참고&nbsp;부탁드립니다.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
